        "quotedText": "'Data Incident' means a breach of Bitrix24 security leading to the accidental or unlawful destruction, loss, alteration, unauthorised disclosure of, or access to, User Personal Data on systems managed by or otherwise controlled by Alaio . 'Data Incidents' will not include unsuccessful attempts or activities that do not compromise the security of User Personal Data, including unsuccessful log-in attempts, pings, port scans, denial of service attacks, and other network attacks on firewalls or networked systems.",
